---
source: crates/hird-check/tests/modules.rs
expression: "check_modules(&[(\"Worker\", WORKER),\n(\"App\",\n\"module App\\n\\\n             use Worker.{Runner, WorkerMsg}\\n\\\n             supervisor AppSup {\\n\\\n               strategy: one_for_one,\\n\\\n               intensity: 1,\\n\\\n               period: 5,\\n\\\n               children: [\\n\\\n                 { id: worker, actor: Runner, start_args: 1, restart: transient },\\n\\\n               ]\\n\\\n             }\\n\\\n             pub fn worker() -> Pid<WorkerMsg> = child(AppSup, worker)\",),])"
---
== App ==
worker : () → Pid<WorkerMsg>
== Worker ==
Do : String → WorkerMsg
Halt : WorkerMsg
run : { job: String } → () ! {Tool<Run>}
